### Click "Send Request" above each block (VS Code "REST Client" extension, or Visual Studio).
### Change the port if `dotnet run` prints a different one.
@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health: is the API up and connected to MySQL?
GET {{host}}/api/health

### All packages
GET {{host}}/api/packages

### Only packages that are En Route
GET {{host}}/api/packages?status=EnRoute

### One package
GET {{host}}/api/packages/3141-5926-5358

### Check in a new package (Operator)
POST {{host}}/api/packages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "barcode": "9999-0000-1111",
  "lockerId": "Locker Array 1",
  "buildingCode": "ML",
  "lengthIn": 12, "widthIn": 8, "heightIn": 6, "weightLb": 5,
  "priority": "Standard"
}

### Update status (Courier)
PATCH {{host}}/api/packages/9999-0000-1111/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Loaded", "location": "Central Hub", "description": "Loaded onto Cart 1" }

### Buildings and carts
GET {{host}}/api/buildings
###
GET {{host}}/api/carts

### Preferences (user 1)
GET {{host}}/api/preferences/1
###
PUT {{host}}/api/preferences/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "notifyEmail": true, "notifyText": true, "phone": "507-555-0123", "preferredWindow": "Morning", "preferredBuildingCode": "ML", "fallbackPreference": "Nearest", "signatureOnFile": false }
